From d36cc2dbcf8bcbf82ab99bf36214fc9304ab6c36 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NVR <rkwastavich@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 00:48:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] NVR extension 1.2: pixel shader replacements

RegisterShaderReplacement: a SPIR-V fragment shader bound in place of DXVK's
conversion of a given D3D9 pixel shader (matched by bytecode hash in
CreateShaderModule), with the game's textures, samplers, float constants and
shared push data still flowing, plus NVR's own resources in set 4
(SetReplacementResources). The original's analysis stays in use.
